WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.191
Unit twelve. Sugar and Salt!

2
00:00:04.143 --> 00:00:08.368
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.418 --> 00:00:11.815
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.865 --> 00:00:15.653
Today we learn about Sugar and Salt. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.381 --> 00:00:19.747
Sugar. Say it with me. Sugar!

6
00:00:23.245 --> 00:00:26.462
Salt. Say it with me. Salt!

7
00:00:29.967 --> 00:00:33.250
Label. Say it with me. Label!

8
00:00:36.735 --> 00:00:40.235
Snack. Say it with me. Snack!

9
00:00:43.734 --> 00:00:47.067
Soda. Say it with me. Soda!

10
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:53.666
Teeth. Say it with me. Teeth!

11
00:00:57.164 --> 00:01:01.431
Blood pressure. Say it with me. Blood pressure!

12
00:01:04.925 --> 00:01:08.175
Limit. Say it with me. Limit!

13
00:01:11.686 --> 00:01:21.647
Too much sugar can harm my teeth, and too much salt can raise blood pressure later in life. Many snacks and sodas have hidden sugar and salt. I read the label and limit them.

14
00:01:21.697 --> 00:01:22.862
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.093 --> 00:01:29.321
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.371 --> 00:01:30.521
Label!

17
00:01:31.426 --> 00:01:36.501
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.551 --> 00:01:37.927
Blood pressure!

19
00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:44.868
Did you know? Many packaged snacks contain much more salt than homemade food!

20
00:01:44.918 --> 00:01:47.034
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.719 --> 00:01:55.367
Think and answer. Name a snack that is high in salt.

22
00:01:55.417 --> 00:01:56.567
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.711 --> 00:02:02.483
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.533 --> 00:02:05.013
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

